### GET all collections
GET https://{{host}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/{{version}}/collections HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: token {{$dotenv TOKEN}}


### GET collection by id
GET https://{{host}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/{{version}}/collections/{{collectionId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: token {{$dotenv TOKEN}}


### POST create collection
POST https://{{host}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/{{version}}/collections HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: token {{$dotenv TOKEN}}

{
    "name": "My Collection"
}


### PATCH update collection
PATCH https://{{host}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/{{version}}/collections/{{collectionId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: token {{$dotenv TOKEN}}

{
    "name": "My Renamed Collection",
    "defaultListId": "{{listId}}"
}


### DELETE collection
DELETE https://{{host}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/{{version}}/collections/{{collectionId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: token {{$dotenv TOKEN}}
